// ATROpenAndFill opens a stream as [Core.ATROpen] does and also writes the
// outputs over the whole history, as [Core.ATR] writes them for bars 0 through
// len(inHigh)-1, returning that range.
//
// Each output must hold len(inHigh) minus [Core.ATRLookback] values and share
// no memory with an input or another output.
//
